Clean-room posture
------------------
This repository and every release of Age of Gold contain only our own code and
data. No file, asset, text, executable code or decompiled code from either
game is included. The tool reads the player's own installed copies of both
games, on the player's machine, and writes the mod there; that output is never
distributed.
